IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MEDUSA-SPECULATION.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-HEADS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ACCEPTED-TOKENS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CANDIDATE-DEPTH     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X10         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MEDUSA.
    IF NUM-HEADS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 4 TO CANDIDATE-DEPTH.
    MOVE ACCEPTED-TOKENS TO SPEEDUP-X10.
    MULTIPLY 65 BY SPEEDUP-X10.
    DIVIDE 10 INTO SPEEDUP-X10.
    ADD 10 TO SPEEDUP-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-HEADS.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-X10.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
